nsibility seriously, but is regarded as arrogant, weak leadership, hot temper. Also no decision-making evidence. So we maintain vote for C.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: I agree with C, D lacks decision-making evidence, and his temperament concerns further reduce suitability. Vote C.\n\nNow metadata: vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
